            "The growth edge is to let your identity breathe without needing to control the outcome, and to trust that the long, sometimes difficult road you're on is building something durable. This placement asks more effort of you than an easy, sunlit Sun would — but the reward is uncommon resilience and a self that is genuinely tempered rather than merely confident. Aimed with patience, your seriousness becomes real authority.",
