            "There's a real strategist here. You'd rather win by being smart and fair than by overpowering anyone, and you can be genuinely effective at rallying people toward a goal because you make them feel considered. The catch is that Mars in a sign of balance can hesitate, weigh both sides too long, or avoid the direct confrontation that would actually clear the air — so decisiveness is the muscle to build. When you do commit, you commit cleanly.",
