            "This is a mind built for teaching, advising, and translating vision into language. You can be persuasive and inspiring when you speak from conviction, and you have a natural instinct for the broad frame that helps other people make sense of things. Sitting right beside Jupiter, your intelligence is lifted toward wisdom and optimism — you don't just process information, you look for what it means.",
            "The honest nuance is that Sagittarius is not Mercury's easiest home: your mind prefers the sweeping principle to the fine print, so you can gloss over details, overgeneralise, or get so attached to the big idea that you skip the careful step. Pair your natural reach for meaning with a bit of Mercury's precision — slow down, check the specifics, follow the argument all the way through — and this becomes a genuinely powerful, wide-ranging intelligence. Cultivating your mind and your voice is, quite literally, cultivating your success.",
